  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "SD6/cGncIg5/DNKD1U97XoIfaUw=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-14T12:35:14.000Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "# editors use the modern React hooks pattern from reactor-browser\n\nDocument editors follow a consistent pattern using auto-generated hooks from `@powerhousedao/reactor-browser`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateId } from \"document-model/core\";\nimport { useSelectedTodoDocument } from \"todo-app/document-models/todo\";\nimport { addTodo } from \"todo-app/document-models/todo\";\n\nexport default function Editor() {\n  const [document, dispatch] = useSelectedTodoDocument();\n\n  function handleAddTodo(values: { title: string }) {\n    if (values.title) {\n      dispatch(addTodo({ id: generateId(), title: values.title }));\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nKey points:\n- `useSelectedXDocument` is auto-generated per document model \u2014 since [[useSelectedDocument hook is auto-generated per document model]], never implement it manually\n- The hook **and** the action creators both come from the same document-model barrel (`todo-app/document-models/todo`) \u2014 not from a deep `gen/creators.js` path, and not from an `editors/hooks/` folder\n- Since `generateId()` from `document-model` is non-deterministic (it returns `globalThis.crypto.randomUUID()`), IDs must be generated in the editor **before** dispatch and passed through the action input -- never inside the reducer, which must stay replay-deterministic\n\n---\n\nTopics:\n- [[editor patterns]]\n- [[model-editor wiring]]\n\n_Corrected 2026-08-13 against Powerhouse v6.2.2-dev.45._",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T12:35:14.000Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-14T12:35:14.000Z"
    }
  },
